{
  "slug": "datahub-skills",
  "name": "Datahub Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "DataHub development and interaction toolkit with connector planning, PR review, catalog search, metadata enrichment, lineage tracing, data quality management, and connection setup skills",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**, **4 agents** and **8 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `datahub-connector-planning` (Plans new DataHub connectors by classifying the source system, researching it using a dedicated agent or inline research,…), `datahub-connector-pr-review` (Reviews DataHub connector implementations against 22 golden standards for compliance, code quality, silent failures, test coverage, type design,…), `datahub-enrich` (Use this skill when the user wants to add or update metadata in DataHub: descriptions, tags, glossary terms,…), `datahub-evals` (Use this skill to run DataHub's saved evals and report answers for judging), `datahub-lineage` (Use this skill when the user wants to explore lineage, trace data dependencies, perform impact analysis, find root…), `datahub-mfe-configure-app` (Configure a DataHub instance to load and display a Micro Frontend (MFE) app), `datahub-mfe-create-app` (Scaffold a new DataHub Micro Frontend (MFE) app with all boilerplate files), `datahub-quality` (Use this skill when the user wants to manage data quality in DataHub: create or run assertions, check…), and 5 more\n- **Agents** (4): `comment-resolution-checker` (Use this agent when you need to verify whether a PR author has genuinely addressed previous review comments…), `connector-researcher` (Research source systems for DataHub connector development), `connector-validator` (Run provided validation scripts, analyze their output, and report results for DataHub connector verification steps), `metadata-searcher` (Execute DataHub search, browse, and lineage operations, retrieve entity metadata, and return structured results)\n- **Commands** (8): `catalog-enrich` (Add or update metadata in DataHub - descriptions, tags, glossary terms, ownership), `catalog-lineage` (Explore lineage, trace data dependencies, and perform impact analysis), `catalog-quality` (Manage data quality — assertions, incidents, and subscriptions), `catalog-search` (Search the DataHub catalog and answer questions about your data), `catalog-setup` (Set up DataHub connection, install CLI, configure authentication and default scopes), `connector-planning` (Plan a new DataHub connector - research the source system, map entities, design architecture, and create a planning…), `connector-review` (Review DataHub connector code for standards compliance and quality), `load-standards` (Read and confirm all golden connector standard files have been loaded)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install datahub-skills@claude-plugins-official` from `datahub-project/datahub-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
